{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-q-connection-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-q-connection-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the categorical $q$-connection","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-q-connection","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-connection-exists","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-substrate-parameter"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-q-connection-exists"],"tags":["existence","q-connection"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.exists","text":"categorical-q-connection-exists.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-q-connection-exists\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe with categorical connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code>. The categorical <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla_q</code> exists as a morphism <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A \\to \\Omega^1(A)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection-exists.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.18.4"}
